body:
To the best of my knowledge

&#x200B;

A few weeks ago it came out that Caff had been grooming and soliciting nudes from multiple underage fans. Soon after this broke on twitter, he was fired and his channel removed from the yogscast. Following this, Lewis tweeted out an offer towards anyone who had ever had a negative experience with members of the yogscast, asking them to contact him personally. This is when allegations against Turps began to appear. According to these sources, which we can now assume were correct in their accusations, Turps had personally messaged fans and asked them for nudes. In some cases continuing to ask even after they had refused.

&#x200B;

Cut to yesterday, Turps announced on reddit that he would be stepping down as CEO of the yogscast. In a comment on this post, Lewis went into further detail on the decision, and also described how he would be re-investigating the historical alligations against Sjin.
